OL,3,GNEWSACider farms report 'lighter' apple
OL,4,Acrops in heat
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the trees looked "autumnal
OL,7,Falready" but reassured customers there
OL,8,Fwould still be "plenty of cider" for
OL,9,Fthe rest of the season after a
OL,10,Fsuccessful crop last year.
OL,12,FLorraine O'Connor, director of a cider
OL,13,Ffarm in Redruth, said their apples had
OL,14,Falready started dropping from the trees
OL,15,Fresulting a smaller yield compared to
OL,16,Flast year.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
